# "As Iona enters, choose a color" (K:ETBReplacement:Other:ChooseColor) runs
# on the entering card before it lands (ADR-0022, CardFactoryUtil.java:
# 515-543), so the choice is on the permanent: the opponent cannot cast a red
# spell (Iona's CantBeCast of Card.ChosenColor) but still casts a white one.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 W
tapformana human 3 W
tapformana human 4 W
tapformana human 5 W
tapformana human 6 W
tapformana human 7 W
tapformana human 8 W
tapformana human 9 W
tapformana human 10 W
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
queue colorchoice R
castspell human 1
resolvestack
tapformana ai 13 R
tapformana ai 14 W
# Lightning Bolt is red: refused, still in hand.
castspell ai 11
# Raise the Alarm is white: cast, {1}{W} paid with both lands.
queue paygeneric R
castspell ai 12
resolvestack
